---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="How We Rate & Review | AITrader EA">
  <div class="container max-w-3xl mx-auto px-6 py-24 prose prose-invert prose-primary">
    <h1>Our Rigorous Testing Methodology</h1>
    <p>At AITrader EA, trust is our most valuable asset. Our rankings are not for sale. Here is how we ensure 100% objective, data-driven reviews.</p>
    
    <h2>1. Independent Acquisition</h2>
    <p>We purchase or sign up for every service anonymously. We never use "reviewer accounts" that might receive preferential treatment or augmented statistics.</p>
    
    <h2>2. Live Testing & Backtesting</h2>
    <p>Every product undergoes a minimum 30-day live test. We measure actual performance, hidden fees, customer service responsiveness, and withdrawal/payout speeds.</p>
    
    <h2>3. The 5-Point Scoring System</h2>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Performance / Quality (30%):</strong> Does the product actually deliver on its promises?</li>
      <li><strong>Value for Money (20%):</strong> Pricing structure compared to industry averages.</li>
      <li><strong>Reliability (20%):</strong> Uptime, bug frequency, and stability.</li>
      <li><strong>Customer Support (15%):</strong> Speed and helpfulness of the support team.</li>
      <li><strong>User Experience (15%):</strong> Ease of use and onboarding.</li>
    </ul>
    
    <h2>4. Continuous Monitoring</h2>
    <p>Our reviews are never static. If a top-rated service degrades in quality, changes its terms, or fails payouts, we immediately downgrade their score and alert our newsletter subscribers.</p>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>